  - id: equipment.algae_canister
    name: Phagia Canister
    purpose: "Booter\u2019s attached living-algae reserve, carried for eating, drinking
      and treating injuries. The canister holds the survival supply rather than creating
      a separate meal or drink each time it is used; its existing attachment and
      reserve rules still apply."
    category: Tools
    tier: T3
    rarity: Rare
    artName: phagia-canister-v1
