  - id: proposal.natural.iron_stock
    name: Consolidated iron bar stock
    purpose: Worked iron consolidated into unfitted bars for fasteners, tool bodies
      and structural fittings. It is the metal-working stage after an iron bloom
      or selected ore has been processed, rather than another grade of loose ore.
      Final section, grade and forging conditions remain to be chosen.
    category: Crafting components
    tier: T1
    rarity: Common
    artName: consolidated-iron-bar-stock-painted-hue-study-v1
    sourceStatus: catalog revision 154
