  - id: component.mining.bone_shaft
    name: Bone multi-tool shaft
    purpose: A full-length shaped stone-bone shaft for the two-handed T0 or T1 multi-tool.
      It provides the head seat and long handhold; the T1 variant captures textured
      gripping-pad scales between its fitted end hardware.
    category: Crafting components
    tier: T0
    rarity: Common
    artName: bone-multi-tool-shaft-painted-hue-study-v1
