    name: Forged iron digging head
    purpose: A full-size transverse forged iron head combining a downturned broad
      hoe/adze-like digging blade and an opposite rough blunt hammer poll. It mounts
      on the T1 stone-bone shaft for shallow digging, prying and crude hammering.
