    name: Unconsolidated iron bloom
    purpose: A rough mass of iron-bearing metal from the proposed smelting stage,
      awaiting consolidation into usable working stock. It precedes the consolidated
      iron bars and steel-making branches. Metal yield, entrained residue and the
      required working process remain unqualified.
