  - id: tool.utility_harness
    name: Utility harness
    purpose: A simple waist harness belt with two attachment mounts. Supports the
      Personal Phagia canister and the dust harvester canister in this loadout.
    category: Tools
    tier: 
    rarity: 
    artName: utility-harness-v1
